ing the boundaries of what\u2019s possible in virtual reality.\n\nDiscover DeoVR\u2019s unique Passthrough mode, blending VR seamlessly into your real surroundings for a lifelike experience \u2014 and a first step into the world of AR videos.\n\nComing soon:\n- Local playback \u2014 watch videos stored on your headset\n\n- Volumetric videos \u2014 move freely through immersive scenes\n\n- Build Your Own Journey (BYOJ) \u2014 shape your own interactive adventures", "short_description": "Discover next-level immersive video on your VR headset \u2014 now with stunning 8K resolution and real-world passthrough mode that makes every scene feel real."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://deovr.com/pages/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://deovr.com/pages/terms", "publisher_name": "Infomediji d.o.o", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://deovr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25395215883443196"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1913518949507267"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1913518949507267"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1764153480, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1913518949507267"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes"